---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Alexander Mathai"
  description="A plain description of what data this site collects, how it's used, and how to contact us about it."
>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">A short, plain description of what this site collects and why.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose privacy-body">
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a static site with one form: the contact form at <a
          href="/contact"
          class="text-link">/contact</a
        >. That form is not yet connected to a delivery service — as of now, submitting it does not
        send your information anywhere. Once a delivery destination is connected, this page will be
        updated to describe exactly what's collected (name, organization, email, and the details you
        provide about your inquiry) and how it's used; it will not be sold.
      </p>
      <p>
        The theme preference (light or dark) you choose is stored in your browser's local storage,
        on your device only. It is not sent anywhere.
      </p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not currently run third-party analytics. If privacy-respecting, aggregate
        analytics are enabled in the future, this page will be updated to name the specific service
        used.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not set tracking cookies.</p>
      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        This site links out to social platforms and, where relevant, to other Texas Movement
        International properties. Those destinations have their own privacy practices, separate from
        this site's.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        There is no verified direct contact route published on this site yet — see the <a
          href="/contact"
          class="text-link">contact page</a
        > for current status.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-body h2 {
    margin-block: var(--space-3) var(--space-1);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .privacy-body p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
